DOCSIS

Hybrid fiber-coaxial (HFC)
    High-capacity highway that carries vast amount of data using a blend of fiber-optic and coaxial cables

Data Over Cable Service (DOCSIS)
    Standardizes how data is transmitted over a hybrid fiber-coaxial network

    Upstream (Out from you're house)
        Between 5 - 42 MHz

    Downstream
        Between 50 - 860 MHz (Data recieved)

    This manages traffic and makes sure no collisions in traffic jam

    Cable Modems are always asynchronus. Upload and download will be different

    